            "name": "High On Racing",
            "steam_appid": 362610,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race the clock above the clouds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your hovercraft onto suspended tracks where every turn, jump and detour costs precious time. High On Racing combines arcade speed with maze navigation and collectible hunting across 15 original stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is to collect every red diamond before the countdown runs out. Pick up clocks to gain extra time, gather yellow diamonds for points, and keep your craft on the track as you search for the route ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Read the track. Plan your moves.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide left and right to line up your approach, manage your speed, and use special track tiles to change direction, jump or boost forward. Learning what each tile does—and reaching it from the right position—is essential to finding your way through each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick reactions will help you survive, but knowing where to go can make the difference between another crash and a successful run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn the routes and chase a higher score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore branching paths, discover tucked-away diamonds and improve your approach with each attempt. Balance the search for extra points against the time remaining, navigate obstacles and push through all 15 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 original maze-like tracks suspended above the clouds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player challenges built around timed diamond collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical movement using lateral steering and special track tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumps, boosts, obstacles and time-extending pickups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score chasing, Steam achievements and leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive retro visuals and the original soundtrack.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The original game, updated</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created in 2002, High On Racing returns with an update that preserves its original tracks, distinctive visuals and tactical arcade gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The updated original includes 16:9 gameplay, native Windows, Linux and Apple Silicon macOS builds, improved camera movement, corrected rendering and fixes to timing, collisions, audio and settings.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race the clock above the clouds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your hovercraft onto suspended tracks where every turn, jump and detour costs precious time. High On Racing combines arcade speed with maze navigation and collectible hunting across 15 original stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is to collect every red diamond before the countdown runs out. Pick up clocks to gain extra time, gather yellow diamonds for points, and keep your craft on the track as you search for the route ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Read the track. Plan your moves.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide left and right to line up your approach, manage your speed, and use special track tiles to change direction, jump or boost forward. Learning what each tile does—and reaching it from the right position—is essential to finding your way through each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick reactions will help you survive, but knowing where to go can make the difference between another crash and a successful run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn the routes and chase a higher score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore branching paths, discover tucked-away diamonds and improve your approach with each attempt. Balance the search for extra points against the time remaining, navigate obstacles and push through all 15 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 original maze-like tracks suspended above the clouds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player challenges built around timed diamond collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical movement using lateral steering and special track tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumps, boosts, obstacles and time-extending pickups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score chasing, Steam achievements and leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive retro visuals and the original soundtrack.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The original game, updated</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created in 2002, High On Racing returns with an update that preserves its original tracks, distinctive visuals and tactical arcade gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The updated original includes 16:9 gameplay, native Windows, Linux and Apple Silicon macOS builds, improved camera movement, corrected rendering and fixes to timing, collisions, audio and settings.</p>",
            "short_description": "Race against the clock on 15 maze-like tracks high above the clouds. Pilot your hovercraft, collect red diamonds, grab extra time and use special track tiles to turn, jump and find your way forward. A retro arcade challenge of quick reactions, route planning and precision.",
